msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:87
#: 97153b882fc64e44abaf84f40839bdea
msgid "The PPM pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:89
#: b7a5ecc459a14ad7b355600d81eeb537
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART4) would need to be used for receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:91
#: fc5129d9c378431e9c02db2712a54112
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:93
#: b613a7c497294604b2d7167a5bd6c106
msgid "FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"15\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:95
#: 0ab05e76e60749ea99e34927f3774463
msgid "CRSF/ELRS would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:97
#: 7017c1e6fadf4623b2e7e09dc6aed86c
msgid "SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-pixhawkv6X.rst:99
#: c79e6fefcf404ec287a3637450276af2
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

